  "definition": "Access to Child Care Settings",
  "effectiveDate": "2025-03-27",
  "expirationDate": "2035-03-27",
  "historyNote": "#12223, eff 7-10-17; ss by #13065, eff 7-1-20; ss by #14095, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 10-9-24; ss by #14222, eff 3-27-25, EXPIRES: 3-27-35",
